h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px; } ul { margin: 4px 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; } li { margin-bottom: 3px; }
</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.9 (build 833)</h2>
<ul>
<li>Export Movie checks the size before it starts: when a desqueezed or large picture is past what H.264 can take (4096 per side), it says so and offers to export as HEVC instead of failing after the frames were rendered.</li>
<li>A delivery that can&#8217;t make its staging folder now says so in the app rather than failing silently.</li>
<li>Maintenance: a share that ends leaves nothing behind for the next one to re-announce.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
